@annual_budget
title: The annual budget council
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_passed = 0;
Q.annual_budget_fiscal_year =
    (Number(Q.annual_budget_year) || Number(Q.year) || 0) + 1;
Q.annual_budget_internal_backing = 0;
Q.annual_budget_internal_vetoes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_margin = 0;
Q.annual_budget_shortfall = 0;
Q.annual_budget_threshold = 0;
Q.annual_budget_present = 0;
Q.annual_budget_strategy = "Unsettled";
Q.annual_budget_posture = "Unsettled";
Q.annual_budget_concession = "None";
Q.annual_budget_concession_code = 0;
Q.annual_budget_negotiation_success = 0;
Q.annual_budget_negotiation_outcome = 0;
Q.annual_budget_concession_strength = 0;
Q.annual_budget_cabinet_response =
    "No amendment has been put to the cabinet";
Q.annual_budget_left_yes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_no = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_abstain = 0;
Q.annual_budget_government_yes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_government_abstain = 0;
Q.budget_confidence_triggered = 0;
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 0;
Q.budget_rescue_attempted = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority =
    Q.left_in_government &&
    Q.government_has_confidence &&
    !Q.caretaker_government ? 1 : 0;
/*
 * The December scene is the parliamentary decision, not the moment when the
 * Council of Ministers first submitted the draft.  Model the constitutional
 * clock from the normal end-of-September submission, three monthly turns
 * before this vote.
 */
Q.budget_submission_time = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.time) || 0) - 3
);
Q.budget_submission_year = Number(Q.year) || Q.annual_budget_year;
Q.budget_submission_month = 9;
Q.budget_deadline_time = Q.budget_submission_time + 4;
const budgetDeadlineIndex =
    Q.budget_submission_year * 12 +
    Math.max(0, Q.budget_submission_month - 1) + 4;
Q.budget_deadline_year = Math.floor(budgetDeadlineIndex / 12);
Q.budget_deadline_month = budgetDeadlineIndex % 12 + 1;
const budgetMonthNames = [
    "January", "February", "March", "April", "May", "June",
    "July", "August", "September", "October", "November", "December"
];
Q.budget_deadline_label =
    budgetMonthNames[Q.budget_deadline_month - 1] +
    " " + Q.budget_deadline_year;
Q.budget_deadline_active = 1;
const previewTotal = Math.max(
    1,
    Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460)
);
const previewLeft = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        previewTotal,
        Math.round(Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
    )
);
let previewGovernment = Math.round(
    Number(Q.coalition_seats) || 0
);
if (previewGovernment <= 0) {
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        previewGovernment = Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0);
    } else if (Q.government_party == "ko") {
        previewGovernment =
            Math.round(Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
            Math.round(Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
            Math.round(Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0);
    } else if (Q.government_party == "psl") {
        previewGovernment =
            Math.round(Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0);
    } else if (Q.government_party == "p2050") {
        previewGovernment =
            Math.round(Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0);
    }
}
const previewExternalLeftSupport =
    !Q.left_in_government &&
    (
        Q.position == "Confidence-and-supply opposition" ||
        String(Q.left_cabinet_model || "").toLowerCase()
            .includes("confidence and supply")
    );
if (previewExternalLeftSupport) {
    previewGovernment = Math.max(
        0,
        previewGovernment - Math.max(
            previewLeft,
            Math.round(Number(Q.left_committed_seats) || 0)
        )
    );
}
previewGovernment = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(previewTotal - previewLeft, previewGovernment)
);
const previewStress =
    (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) +
    (Q.caretaker_government ? 12 : 0) +
    (!Q.government_has_confidence ? 8 : 0);
const previewDefections = Math.min(
    previewGovernment,
    Math.max(0, Math.round((previewStress - 35) / 8))
);
Q.annual_budget_preview_government_yes =
    previewGovernment - previewDefections;
Q.annual_budget_preview_government_abstain = previewDefections;
Q.annual_budget_preview_other_no = Math.max(
    0,
    previewTotal - previewGovernment - previewLeft
);
Q.annual_budget_preview_left_seats = previewLeft;
Q.annual_budget_preview_reject_no =
    Q.annual_budget_preview_other_no + previewLeft;
Q.annual_budget_preview_support_yes =
    Q.annual_budget_preview_government_yes + previewLeft;
!}

= December [+ annual_budget_year +] — fiscal year [+ annual_budget_fiscal_year +]

[? if annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority: A budget is the coalition agreement
with numbers attached. Every governing caucus wants proof that office
purchased delivery, while every partner also wants room for its own electoral
identity. The President cannot use an ordinary veto to erase an adopted
budget, but delay and constitutional conflict can still weaponise the
process.?]

[? if not annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority: **[+ government_owner +]**
owns this bill. Lewica has no state-budget capacity: it can oppose, negotiate a
published concession, tolerate the bill for stability, or lend conditional
support. Party resources pay for drafting, whips and monitoring—not state
programmes. The government's text must still win an ordinary Sejm majority;
it does not pass automatically because Lewica is outside cabinet.?]

[? if not annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority:
<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">Current whip estimate</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Cabinet yes</span><b>[+ annual_budget_preview_government_yes +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Other opposition no</span><b>[+ annual_budget_preview_other_no +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Lewica controls</span><b>[+ annual_budget_preview_left_seats +] votes</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">Vote no: [+ annual_budget_preview_government_yes +] yes · [+ annual_budget_preview_reject_no +] no. Abstain: [+ annual_budget_preview_government_yes +] yes · [+ annual_budget_preview_other_no +] no. Support: [+ annual_budget_preview_support_yes +] yes · [+ annual_budget_preview_other_no +] no.</div></div>
An ordinary bill passes only when yes exceeds no with a quorum. The estimate
shows the direct consequence of each posture before any agreement is signed.?]

The draft was recorded as submitted in **September [+ budget_submission_year
+]**, so the constitutional budget clock expires in **[+ budget_deadline_label
+]**. A defeat today does not itself dismiss the cabinet or dissolve the Sejm.

