go-to: opposition_negotiation_result

@opposition_bargain_walk
title: End the talks and vote no
subtitle: No deal, no resource cost and no ambiguity about responsibility.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_strategy = "Negotiations refused — opposition vote";
Q.annual_budget_posture = "Oppose";
Q.annual_budget_concession = "None";
Q.annual_budget_left_no = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
);
Q.party_unity += 2;
Q.media_capacity += 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica ends budget talks and leaves responsibility with the cabinet";
!}
go-to: opposition_roll

@opposition_negotiation_result
title: The cabinet answers
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 0

**[+ negotiation_last_result +]**
Score **[+ negotiation_last_score +]** · required **[+
negotiation_last_threshold +]**.

[? if annual_budget_negotiation_outcome = 2: The cabinet has accepted the full
written demand. Lewica may now abstain, sign a conditional-support pact and
vote yes, or reject the answer and vote no.?]
[? if annual_budget_negotiation_outcome = 1: The cabinet has made a narrower
counteroffer. Lewica may accept it for abstention or reject it and vote no;
the counteroffer is not enough to justify affirmative support.?]
[? if annual_budget_negotiation_outcome = 0: The cabinet has rejected the
amendment. The drafting resource is spent and the only coherent parliamentary
response is a no vote.?]

The response changes no state programme by itself. The cabinet still owns the
bill, expenditure and implementation; an accepted clause takes effect only
after the budget passes.

- @opposition_accept_abstention
- @opposition_accept_support
- @opposition_reject_response

@opposition_accept_abstention
title: Accept the written clause and abstain
subtitle: Lewica supplies no yes votes; the cabinet must carry its own bill.
view-if: annual_budget_negotiation_outcome >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.annual_budget_posture = "Abstain on written terms";
Q.annual_budget_strategy += " — accepted for abstention";
Q.annual_budget_left_yes = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_no = 0;
Q.annual_budget_left_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
);
Q.party_unity -=
    Q.annual_budget_negotiation_outcome == 1 ? 3 : 2;
Q.razem_dissent +=
    Q.annual_budget_negotiation_outcome == 1 ? 5 : 3;
Q.barons_dissent -= 2;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") Q.pis_relation += 2;
else if (Q.government_party == "ko") Q.ko_relation += 2;
else if (Q.government_party == "psl") Q.psl_relation += 2;
else Q.p2050_relation += 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica accepts a written clause but leaves passage to the cabinet";
!}
go-to: opposition_roll

@opposition_accept_support
