go-to: poland_events_2026.snap_formation_attempt_one

@budget_vote
title: Caucus whips count the chamber
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
const sejmTotal = Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460);
const leftSeats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) || 0);
let governingSeats = Number(Q.coalition_seats);
if (!Number.isFinite(governingSeats) || governingSeats <= 0) {
    governingSeats =
        (Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) +
        (Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
        leftSeats;
}
governingSeats = Math.max(0, Math.min(sejmTotal, Math.round(governingSeats)));
const leftBacking = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(100, Number(Q.annual_budget_internal_backing) || 0)
);
const leftRebels = Math.min(
    leftSeats,
    Math.round(leftSeats * (100 - leftBacking) / 100) +
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.annual_budget_internal_vetoes) || 0)
);
const coalitionStress =
    (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) +
    Math.max(0, 45 - (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0)) * 0.35 +
    Math.max(0, 40 - (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0)) * 0.55 +
    (Q.third_way_split ? 5 : 0) +
    (Q.p2050_split ? 4 : 0);
const partnerDefections = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round((coalitionStress - 34) / 5)
);
const strategyBonus =
    Q.annual_budget_strategy == "Rural-social compact" ? 7 :
    (Q.annual_budget_strategy == "Funded social protocol" ? 2 :
    (Q.annual_budget_strategy == "Fiscal minimum" ? 5 : -4));
Q.annual_budget_yes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        sejmTotal,
        governingSeats - leftRebels - partnerDefections + strategyBonus
    )
);
Q.annual_budget_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        sejmTotal - Q.annual_budget_yes,
        4 + leftRebels + Math.floor(partnerDefections / 2)
    )
);
Q.annual_budget_no =
    sejmTotal - Q.annual_budget_yes - Q.annual_budget_abstain;
Q.annual_budget_present =
    Q.annual_budget_yes +
    Q.annual_budget_no +
    Q.annual_budget_abstain;
Q.annual_budget_threshold = Q.annual_budget_no + 1;
Q.annual_budget_passed =
    Q.annual_budget_present >=
        Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_quorum_floor) || 230) &&
    Q.annual_budget_yes > Q.annual_budget_no ? 1 : 0;
Q.annual_budget_margin = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? Q.annual_budget_yes - Q.annual_budget_no
    : 0;
Q.annual_budget_shortfall = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? 0
    : Math.max(0, Q.annual_budget_no + 1 - Q.annual_budget_yes);
Q.annual_budget_result = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? "Passed " + Q.annual_budget_yes + " to " + Q.annual_budget_no
    : "Failed " + Q.annual_budget_shortfall + " votes short";
Q["annual_budget_done_" + Q.annual_budget_year] = 1;
Q["annual_budget_passed_" + Q.annual_budget_year] =
    Q.annual_budget_passed;
Q.budget_deadline_active = Q.annual_budget_passed ? 0 : 1;
!}

= Sejm roll call

**Yes [+ annual_budget_yes +] · No [+ annual_budget_no +] · Abstain
[+ annual_budget_abstain +]**

[? if annual_budget_passed: The budget carries with **[+
annual_budget_margin +] more yes than no**.?]
[? if not annual_budget_passed: The bill falls **[+
annual_budget_shortfall +]** votes short. A fiscal defeat is now a coalition
crisis, not an automatic no-confidence vote.?]

Required on this roll call: **[+ annual_budget_threshold +] yes**, because
abstentions do not count against an ordinary bill.

- @budget_passed
- @budget_failed

@budget_passed
title: Ratify the result
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_deadline_active = 0;
Q.government_delivery += 4;
if (Q.annual_budget_package_code == 1) {
    Q.government_delivery += 5;
    Q.fiscal_stress += 6;
} else if (Q.annual_budget_package_code == 2) {
    Q.household_security += 4;
    Q.government_delivery += 3;
    Q.fiscal_stress += 3;
} else if (Q.annual_budget_package_code == 3) {
    Q.fiscal_stress -= 3;
}
Q.public_trust += 2;
Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 3;
Q.next_budget_label =
    "December " + (Number(Q.annual_budget_year) + 1);
Q.news_headline =
    "The annual budget passes after a full caucus count";
!}

= The government lives another year

The Senate may amend and delay, but the Sejm majority has survived the only
annual vote every faction knew it could not evade.

- @return_queue: Return to the remaining events

@budget_failed
title: Open the emergency coalition council
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_deadline_active = 1;
Q.budget_confidence_triggered = 0;
Q.coalition_break_threat = 1;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 12;
Q.public_trust -= 4;
Q.early_election_risk += 20;
Q.news_headline =
    "Budget defeat opens a revision clock without dismissing the cabinet";
!}
go-to: confidence_council

@confidence_council
title: Budget defeat — emergency coalition council
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1

= Revision, confidence and election are different procedures

The Sejm rejected one text. The cabinet remains in office and may submit a
revision. A prime-ministerial confidence vote under Article 160 is optional
and uses a simple majority. An early election requires a separate lawful
route; announcing one does not create a caretaker government.

The recorded Article 225 clock expires in **[+ budget_deadline_label +]**.

- @confidence_psl_deal
- @confidence_left_redline
- @confidence_technical_revision
- @confidence_article160
- @confidence_resign
- @confidence_snap

@confidence_psl_deal
title: Reopen the text with a written rural guarantee
subtitle: Cost: 2 governing-capacity points · moves 12 votes toward yes.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
choose-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A state-budget guarantee requires two governing-capacity points; party resources cannot finance it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 2;
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 12;
Q.budget_rescue_attempted = 1;
Q.psl_relation += 12;
Q.progressives_dissent += 5;
Q.razem_dissent += 6;
Q.annual_budget_strategy += " + PSL rescue";
Q.news_headline = "A rural guarantee reopens the budget roll call";
!}
go-to: budget_rescue_roll

@confidence_left_redline
title: Rebuild the majority around the funded Left protocol
subtitle: No capacity cost · moves five votes, but hardens KO and PSL opposition.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 5;
Q.budget_rescue_attempted = 1;
Q.annual_budget_package_code = 1;
Q.party_unity += 4;
Q.labor_credibility += 4;
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.ko_relation -= 5;
Q.psl_relation -= 6;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
Q.annual_budget_strategy += " + Left redline";
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left makes programme delivery the price of a revised budget";
!}
go-to: budget_rescue_roll

@confidence_technical_revision
title: Remove disputed lines and preserve only the coalition minimum
subtitle: Cost: 1 governing-capacity point · moves eight votes; the Left pays the programme cost.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
choose-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Even a technical revision requires one governing-capacity point.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_rescue_bonus = 8;
Q.budget_rescue_attempted = 1;
Q.annual_budget_package_code = 3;
Q.budget -= 1;
Q.ko_relation += 4;
Q.psl_relation += 3;
Q.party_unity -= 4;
Q.labor_credibility -= 4;
Q.razem_dissent += 8;
Q.annual_budget_strategy += " + technical revision";
Q.news_headline =
    "The cabinet strips the budget back to a coalition minimum";
!}
go-to: budget_rescue_roll

@budget_rescue_roll
title: The revised budget returns to the Sejm
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
const rescueTotal = Math.max(
    1,
    Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460)
);
let rescueYes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(rescueTotal, Math.round(Number(Q.annual_budget_yes) || 0))
);
let rescueNo = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        rescueTotal - rescueYes,
        Math.round(Number(Q.annual_budget_no) || 0)
    )
);
let rescueAbstain = Math.max(
    0,
    rescueTotal - rescueYes - rescueNo
);
let votesMoved = Math.min(
    rescueTotal - rescueYes,
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.budget_rescue_bonus) || 0))
);
const movedFromAbstain = Math.min(rescueAbstain, votesMoved);
rescueAbstain -= movedFromAbstain;
rescueYes += movedFromAbstain;
votesMoved -= movedFromAbstain;
const movedFromNo = Math.min(rescueNo, votesMoved);
rescueNo -= movedFromNo;
rescueYes += movedFromNo;
Q.annual_budget_yes = rescueYes;
Q.annual_budget_no = rescueNo;
Q.annual_budget_abstain = rescueAbstain;
Q.annual_budget_present = rescueYes + rescueNo + rescueAbstain;
Q.annual_budget_threshold = rescueNo + 1;
Q.annual_budget_passed =
    Q.annual_budget_present >=
        Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_quorum_floor) || 230) &&
    rescueYes > rescueNo ? 1 : 0;
Q.annual_budget_margin = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? rescueYes - rescueNo
    : 0;
Q.annual_budget_shortfall = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? 0
    : Math.max(0, rescueNo + 1 - rescueYes);
Q["annual_budget_passed_" + Q.annual_budget_year] =
    Q.annual_budget_passed;
Q.budget_deadline_active = Q.annual_budget_passed ? 0 : 1;
Q.annual_budget_result = Q.annual_budget_passed
    ? "Revised budget passed " + rescueYes + " to " + rescueNo
    : "Revised budget failed " + Q.annual_budget_shortfall +
        " votes short";
!}

= Second ordinary-majority roll call

**Yes [+ annual_budget_yes +] · No [+ annual_budget_no +] · Abstain [+
annual_budget_abstain +] · Required [+ annual_budget_threshold +]**

The revised text moves exactly **[+ budget_rescue_bonus +] votes** where that
many no or abstaining deputies are available. It still passes only with more
yes than no.

- @budget_rescue_continue: Record the revised vote

@budget_rescue_continue
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
go-to: budget_rescue_passed if annual_budget_passed = 1; budget_rescue_failed if annual_budget_passed = 0

@budget_rescue_passed
title: The revision lands inside the deadline
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_deadline_active = 0;
Q.government_delivery += 2;
if (Q.annual_budget_package_code == 1) {
    Q.government_delivery += 5;
    Q.fiscal_stress += 6;
} else if (Q.annual_budget_package_code == 2) {
    Q.household_security += 4;
    Q.government_delivery += 3;
    Q.fiscal_stress += 3;
} else if (Q.annual_budget_package_code == 3) {
    Q.fiscal_stress -= 3;
}
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 5;
Q.early_election_risk =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.early_election_risk) - 15);
Q.next_budget_label =
    "December " + (Number(Q.annual_budget_year) + 1);
Q.news_headline =
    "A revised annual budget passes inside the constitutional window";
!}

The cabinet survives because it changed and repassed the budget—not because a
confidence vote silently substituted for legislation.

- @return_queue: Return to the remaining events

@budget_rescue_failed
title: The revised bill also fails
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1 and annual_budget_passed = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget_deadline_active = 1;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 8;
Q.public_trust -= 3;
Q.early_election_risk += 15;
Q.news_headline =
    "A second budget defeat leaves confidence and formation as separate questions";
!}

The cabinet still has not automatically lost confidence. The deadline remains
**[+ budget_deadline_label +]**, but another identical rescue cannot be farmed
for votes.

- @confidence_article160
- @confidence_resign
- @confidence_snap

@confidence_article160
title: Ask the Sejm for confidence under Article 160
subtitle: A separate simple-majority vote; passing it does not enact the defeated budget.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: budget_confidence_triggered = 1; news_headline = "The prime minister separates cabinet confidence from the defeated budget"
go-to: confidence_roll

@confidence_resign
title: Resign and open a new government-formation sequence
subtitle: Creates a caretaker cabinet, not an automatic election.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.government_has_confidence = 0;
Q.caretaker_government = 1;
Q.left_in_government = 0;
Q.formation_in_progress = 1;
Q.budget = 0;
Q.budget_authority =
    "Caretaker — no new governing-spend actions";
Q.position = "Caretaker cabinet and formation talks";
Q.coalition_status = "Cabinet resigned after budget defeat";
Q.coalition_seats = 0;
Q.annual_budget_result =
    "Budget failed — cabinet resigned into formation talks";
Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(65, Q.early_election_risk);
Q.news_headline =
    "The prime minister resigns; the Sejm must attempt another cabinet";
!}

The Palace and Sejm now begin government formation. The budget deadline
continues to matter, but no election has yet been requested or called.

- @formation_after_budget_loss: Begin the first formation attempt

@confidence_snap
title: Request cross-party talks on an early-election route
subtitle: Records a request; it neither dissolves the Sejm nor creates a caretaker cabinet.
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.snap_election_requested = 1;
Q.snap_election_request_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
Q.snap_election_request_year = Number(Q.year) || Q.annual_budget_year;
Q.snap_election_request_month = Number(Q.month) || 12;
Q.snap_election_reason =
    "Budget defeat — self-dissolution or Article 225 talks";
Q.position = "Government seeking a lawful early-election route";
Q.coalition_status =
    "Budget defeated; self-dissolution talks requested";
Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(85, Q.early_election_risk);
Q.annual_budget_result =
    "Budget failed — early-election talks requested";
Q.party_unity -= 4;
Q.news_headline =
    "The coalition requests election talks without pretending the Sejm has dissolved";
!}

= A request, not a dissolution

The cabinet remains in office with its existing confidence status. A Sejm
self-dissolution requires its own two-thirds vote; alternatively, the
President may act after the recorded budget deadline. Until one of those
procedures succeeds, there is no snap-election campaign and no legal
dissolution.

- @return_queue: Return to the remaining events

@confidence_roll
title: Confidence in the sitting prime minister
new-page: true
view-if: annual_budget_left_cabinet_authority = 1
on-arrival: {!
const confidenceTotal = Math.max(
    1,
    Math.round(Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460)
);
let startingYes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        confidenceTotal,
        Math.round(Number(Q.annual_budget_yes) || 0)
    )
);
let startingNo = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        confidenceTotal - startingYes,
        Math.round(Number(Q.annual_budget_no) || 0)
    )
);
let startingAbstain = Math.max(
    0,
    confidenceTotal - startingYes - startingNo
);
let confidenceRecovery = Math.max(
    0,
    4 +
    Math.round(((Number(Q.party_unity) || 0) - 50) / 10) +
    Math.round(
        (
            (Number(Q.ko_relation) || 0) +
            (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0) +
            (Number(Q.p2050_relation) || 0) - 120
        ) / 30
    )
);
confidenceRecovery = Math.min(
    confidenceTotal - startingYes,
    confidenceRecovery
);
const confidenceFromAbstain = Math.min(
    startingAbstain,
    confidenceRecovery
);
startingAbstain -= confidenceFromAbstain;
startingYes += confidenceFromAbstain;
confidenceRecovery -= confidenceFromAbstain;
const confidenceFromNo = Math.min(startingNo, confidenceRecovery);
startingNo -= confidenceFromNo;
startingYes += confidenceFromNo;
Q.confidence_yes = startingYes;
Q.confidence_no = startingNo;
Q.confidence_abstain = startingAbstain;
Q.confidence_present =
    Q.confidence_yes + Q.confidence_no + Q.confidence_abstain;
Q.confidence_threshold = Q.confidence_no + 1;
Q.confidence_mode =
    "Article 160 prime-ministerial confidence — simple majority";
Q.confidence_candidate = Q.prime_minister;
Q.government_has_confidence =
    Q.confidence_present >=
        Math.max(1, Number(Q.sejm_quorum_floor) || 230) &&
    Q.confidence_yes > Q.confidence_no ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.government_has_confidence) {
    Q.annual_budget_result =
        "Budget defeated; cabinet retained confidence " +
        Q.confidence_yes + " to " + Q.confidence_no;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 5;
    Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(0, Q.early_election_risk - 15);
    Q.budget_deadline_active = 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The cabinet survives confidence but still lacks an enacted budget";
} else {
    Q.coalition_broken = 1;
    Q.caretaker_government = 1;
    Q.left_in_government = 0;
    Q.formation_in_progress = 1;
    Q.budget = 0;
    Q.budget_authority =
        "Caretaker — no new governing-spend actions";
    Q.position = "Caretaker cabinet and formation talks";
    Q.coalition_status = "Prime minister lost Article 160 confidence";
    Q.coalition_seats = 0;
    Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(75, Q.early_election_risk);
    Q.annual_budget_result =
        "Budget defeated; cabinet lost confidence " +
        Q.confidence_yes + " to " + Q.confidence_no;
    Q.budget_deadline_active = 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The prime minister loses confidence and opens formation talks";
}
!}

= Confidence roll call

**Yes [+ confidence_yes +] · No [+ confidence_no +] · Abstain [+
confidence_abstain +]**

[? if government_has_confidence: More deputies vote yes than no. The cabinet
survives, but the defeated budget remains defeated and the deadline remains
active.?]
[? if not government_has_confidence: More deputies vote no than yes. The
cabinet becomes caretaker and a new formation sequence begins; that is not
the same as calling an election.?]

- @confidence_kept_return
- @formation_after_budget_loss

@confidence_kept_return
title: Return with the cabinet still in office
view-if: government_has_confidence = 1
go-to: return_queue

@formation_after_budget_loss
title: Begin the first constitutional formation attempt
view-if: government_has_confidence = 0 and caretaker_government = 1
on-arrival: snap_formation_context = "Cabinet loss after annual budget"; snap_formation_attempt = 1; formation_in_progress = 1; news_headline = "The caretaker cabinet enters the first constitutional formation attempt"
go-to: poland_events_2026.snap_formation_attempt_one

@return_queue
go-to: poland_event_queue
